 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.Files.AddFile`, which builds the multipart upload itself from a file
+  name and a content reader (mirroring `CallLogs.AddRecording`) and accepts
+  options for associating the file with a deal, person, organization, product,
+  activity, lead or project.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Make v1 file uploads retryable. `Files.AddFile` encodes the upload into a
+  replayable body, so 429/5xx responses are retried under the configured
+  `RetryPolicy` even when the content is streamed from a source that can only
+  be read once (such as `os.Open` output piped into the request). `Files.Add`
+  still sends the caller-provided body as-is; requests whose body cannot be
+  replayed are deliberately not retried.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
